* op-amp 5: A0=100000, GBW=1000000, output limited to [0, 5]
G_OA5 0 OA5 N008 N005 1
R_OA5 OA5 0 100k
C_OA5 OA5 0 159.1549431n
B_OA5 T5 0 V=min(max(V(OA5), 0), 5)
* op-amp 6: A0=100000, GBW=1000000, output limited to [0, 5]
G_OA6 0 OA6 N008 N006 1
